  "text": "Planning Document: Marrickville DCP 2011 - 2 3 Site Context Analysis\n\nClause 2.3 - setback (development_control): Front setbacks and front projections; • Side setbacks\n\nClause 2.3 - height_limit (development_control): Eaves height\n\nClause 2.3.1 - environmental_protection (environmental_protection): Minimise overshadowing, loss of privacy and views\n\nClause 2.3.3 - other (development_control): The site and context analysis must demonstrate that the development will integrate within the streetscape when considering scale, proportion and massing.\n\nClause 2.3.3 - other (development_control): The site and context analysis must demonstrate that the building is well proportioned, both as an individual element and within the streetscape.\n\nClause 2.3.3 - other (development_control): The site and context analysis must demonstrate that the building will sit comfortably with surrounding buildings in terms of its massing.\n\nClause 2.3.3 - environmental_protection (environmental_protection): Any endangered ecological community (EEC), significant trees or other vegetation (including any unique environmental features) and any other existing trees upon the site or close to the boundaries with adjoining sites\n\n",
